      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "This phone offers an impressive hardware package for its price. The combination of high 12 GB RAM, 256 GB storage, and a versatile periscope zoom camera is rare in this price bracket. Its main compromise is the shorter 3-year update policy.",
